  "descriptionHtml": "<p>A garland of tiny clovers. Fifteen small four petal clovers, each four round stones in gold tone cups with a fine beaded rim around one small clear stone at the centre, are linked petal to petal by fine gold rings, so the line moves softly with the wrist. In sky blue, rose pink or clear white.</p><p><strong>STYLING TIP:</strong> Wear one alone, or the sky blue and the pink together on one wrist.</p><p><strong>Details</strong></p><ul>\n<li>Clovers: Fifteen, approximately 10mm across, linked petal to petal by small gold tone rings</li>\n<li>Stones: Four round cubic zirconia petals per clover, approximately 3.5mm, around a small clear centre stone</li>\n<li>Colours: Sky Blue, Pink or White</li>\n<li>Setting: Gold tone cups with a fine beaded rim</li>\n<li>Length: Approximately 17cm, adjustable to about 21cm with the extender</li>\n<li>Closure: Lobster clasp with an extender chain</li>\n<li>Metal: Stainless steel, polished gold tone</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0680/9606/5698/files/clover-garland-bracelet-size-guide.jpg\" alt=\"Size guide — Clover Garland Bracelet\" width=\"420\"></p><p><strong>Care</strong></p><p>Keep it dry and away from perfume and harsh chemicals. Wipe with a soft dry cloth and store it flat in its pouch.</p><p>You will receive your piece in a Naira Petite box.</p>",
  "seo": {
   "title": "Clover Garland Bracelet | Naira Petite",
   "description": "Fifteen small four petal clovers, each four round stones in gold tone cups with a fine beaded rim around one small clear stone at the centre, are linked petal to petal by fine gold rings, so the line moves softly with the wrist. Clover Garland Bracelet by Naira Petite."
  },
