  "descriptionHtml": "<p>One unbroken line of light. Round brilliant cut clear cubic zirconia of about 3mm, each in its own four claw cup, are linked edge to edge all the way round, with no chain between them and nothing hanging at the front. At about 40cm it sits at the base of the neck, in silver tone or gold tone.</p><p><strong>STYLING TIP:</strong> Wear it alone with an open neckline, or under a longer pendant chain.</p><p><strong>Details</strong></p><ul>\n<li>Stones: Round brilliant cut clear cubic zirconia, approximately 3mm, each in its own four claw cup</li>\n<li>Line: One continuous row, approximately 3mm wide</li>\n<li>Length: Approximately 40cm</li>\n<li>Closure: Box clasp</li>\n<li>Metal: Silver tone or gold tone</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0680/9606/5698/files/riviere-classique-necklace-size-guide.jpg\" alt=\"Size guide — Rivière Classique Necklace\" width=\"420\"></p><p><strong>Care</strong></p><p>Keep it dry and away from perfume and harsh chemicals. Wipe with a soft dry cloth and store it flat in its pouch.</p><p>You will receive your piece in a Naira Petite box.</p>",
