   "title": "Rivière Classique Necklace | Naira Petite",
   "description": "Round brilliant cut clear cubic zirconia of about 3mm, each in its own four claw cup, are linked edge to edge all the way round, with no chain between them and nothing hanging at the front. Rivière Classique Necklace by Naira Petite."
